			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://neighborhood.11ty.dev/@11ty\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>11ty</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Trying to understand subscription vs license: If I back the project I get updates for as long as my subscription runs, and when that ends I can still selfhost with all the Peo features I had at that time? And update the Free part as new versions are released?</p>",
