			"date": "2026-03-03T17:55:25.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://thoresson.social/@anders\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>anders</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://neighborhood.11ty.dev/@11ty\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>11ty</span></a></span> *some* of the Pro features are runtime services, and will require an active subscription to have access to those. For example: collaboration will require an active sub. But the snapshot of your web site will be fully exportable and usable on any host if you decide to cancel</p>",
