			"date": "2026-03-04T14:47:31.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://social.lol/@ewie\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>ewie</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://thoresson.social/@anders\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>anders</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://neighborhood.11ty.dev/@11ty\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>11ty</span></a></span> importantly this funding will go towards improving the free version of Build Awesome/11ty, but the plan right now is that the self hosted version of your site will not include access to the Pro runtime services (but those are enhancements and will be decoupled from the self hosted version). Hopefully that answers your question!</p>",
